# The root .gitignore excludes *.jar, which is right for build output and wrong for these: Orchestra is not
# published yet, so its jars are vendored here and have to be tracked or a fresh clone cannot build the
# migrated integration tests.
#
# Scoped to this directory rather than adding an exception to the root file, so the exception cannot
# accidentally re-include a build artifact somewhere else.
!*.jar
